# FlowRad design (agents)

Read **CURSOR.md** and **design.md** before any UI work.

## Marketplace (`/`, `/library`, `/course/*`, `/authors/*`)

- **No card grids** for browse lists — use editorial hairline rows.
- **Film plane** thumbnails: `components/brand/FilmPlane.tsx`.
- **Accent:** film-marker amber (`accent` token). Not cyan, not purple.
- **Fonts:** Source Sans 3 (UI), Source Serif 4 (display titles).
- **Card** primitive: forms/auth/admin only — not catalog.

## Reading room (`/case/*`)

- Shell hidden; `bg-imaging`; see `design.md` § Teaching surfaces.
- No marketing chrome on the viewport.

## Orchestrator

Backlog and agent routing: `docs/ORCHESTRATOR.md`.
